 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I keep expecting to see them by the fire. Then I remember.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there. You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Violet is gone, Amy is gone, and Badr is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Badr said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Ellie grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "🤝 Ellie is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "You show them Purslane — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Alright, love. Go do what you need to do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"It's quiet today. Wrong kind of quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Stonebridge."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" Back home I was a journalist. Let me show you what that means out here."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I don't need you to believe in me. I need you to watch. That's all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"It's not about them believing in me. It's about me believing it first.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to prove they're useful.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Out there? With YOU leading? ...Let me think about it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Every laugh out there feels wrong today. Then I feel wrong for thinking it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Thanks. ...Thanks for saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Ask around — I know 21 things worth knowing out here. Knowledge is the one thing that multiplies when you give it away.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"I wasn't a blacksmith. I was a locksmith. There are people from my old life I'd rather never find me. That's all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Learned it in Columbus, Ohio, mostly. Locksmith work teaches you fast — the kind that doesn't wait while you read a manual.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"What I'm bad at? asking for help. We all get one fatal flaw. That's mine.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Still on their skills. One step at a time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Brayden rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"We went over this,\" Brayden says, a little tired. \"I already told you the truth about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Alright, duty calls. This was a good pause.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 39,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Elif and I never finished talking about wanting to prove they're useful — we left it mid-thought, 4 days back. You're wearing Elif's shoes now — want to pick it up? 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You can feel the history in how they greet you."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I'm not asking for a medal. I'm asking for a chance to matter.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"wanting to prove they're useful — that's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Right. Sorry, I go on about it. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Pantry's thin and getting thinner. Come forage with me tomorrow — two of us can fill packs.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the far treeline, past the rocks in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Forage with me tomorrow? I know the creek bend, past the treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. Nobody's worked the creek bend, past the treeline in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "David won't meet your eyes. \"I told myself finders keepers. It wasn't finders keepers. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"...Okay. I'll figure it out.\" They won't ask twice. That much is clear."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "«Dobrze, że jesteś. Naprawdę.» \"Food?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod, holding your gaze a beat longer."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. You point at yourself, then at them, then at the fire. Together. They get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "A final shared look — you both feel the talk running its course."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I still need help with the pantry run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Elif always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Elif said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "Ellie nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I should go. Before I overthink this conversation too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the palmyra palm patch past the treeline in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Elif is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I wake before anyone else. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Let me sit with all that. We'll pick it up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "They light up a little when they see you."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"No, really — it's handled. Thanks for asking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"I tried the Ghost Pipe like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"...I should say, I trade in what I know. My knowledge for yours. Or food, if you're short on secrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Calorie Run. They just... took David and Yara. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "🤝 Ivy is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Water's almost gone — 2 liters. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 2 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 66,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Ha. You again. I don't mind this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"What do you miss most? From before.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"God. Yes. I dream about soup. Actual soup, with a spoon.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Did you sleep? I kept hearing things out past the treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "They go still. \"So it's not just me. Good. That's... good to know. Bad, but good.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Still on how you slept.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "It's quiet at the trap line. Amina doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? It'll pass.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You saw it too, right? Hardened The Pit. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Ask me tomorrow. Everything changes by tomorrow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "Ivy nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"The plan is the plan until it isn't. Then we make a new one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "You show them Purslane — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — the need hasn't gone anywhere. I'm still asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 4 liters, 9 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"The Witness. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"I show up. That's my part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "Amina nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Alright — carefully, now. Both of us.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 8 days back. Still on your mind? 'You show them Purslane — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. I never knew that.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "At the hollow the ground is torn up. Something was here, recently, and it wasn't careful. Amina's hand finds your sleeve. You leave together, faster than you came."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"My part? I check the treeline every hour and stay ready.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "David nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "You show them Ghost Pipe — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"The cistern's nearly dry — 0 liters left. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 0 liters, 9 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"I could talk all day, but — go on. We'll talk more.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 89,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? At night I talk to someone who isn't there anymore.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Here. I made an extra.\" Ivy presses something into your hand — a decent tool, oiled and kept. (Useful. Keep it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"We're down to 1 liters of clean water. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 1 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "Amina nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that water haul.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Good — I was hoping you'd stop by. Seen worse.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "On the way, David stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"As I said — We were just talking. Nothing important. Give it time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "Ivy nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 101,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
